@startditaa
' Ditaa: a drawing in characters turned into a picture. Boxes close
' with + - |, round corners with / and \, a dashed side with : or =.
' A code inside a box gives its color (cBLU, c9CF) or its shape:
' {d} a document, {s} storage, {io} input and output, {c} a choice.
/-------------\      +-------------+      /-------------\
| cBLU        |      | cYEL        |      | cGRE        |
|   Commit    +----->|   Build     +----->|   Release   |
|             |      |   and test  |      |             |
\------+------/      +------+------+      \------+------/
       :                    |                    |
       v                    v                    v
+-------------+      +-------------+      +-------------+
| c9CF    {d} |      | cDDD    {s} |      | cFC9   {io} |
|  Changelog  |      |  Artifacts  |      |  Download   |
|             |      |             |      |             |
+-------------+      +-------------+      +-------------+
@endditaa
